// Animated breath: spits Corrosive Spit (summon version NY#ABRX: no casting
// animation, no casting time) at the nearest enemy it sees, at most once per
// round, and only while that enemy is out of melee reach; otherwise it
// attacks in melee (last block).
IF
  See(NearestEnemyOf(Myself))
  !Range(NearestEnemyOf(Myself),4)
  !GlobalTimerNotExpired("NY#ABRSPT","LOCALS")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobalTimer("NY#ABRSPT","LOCALS",6)
    ReallyForceSpellRES("NY#ABRX",NearestEnemyOf(Myself))
END

// Melee. The Mustard Jelly's default script (WTASIGHT) is not used: it
// turns the creature hostile when the party hits it (AttackedBy(GOODCUTOFF)
// then Enemy()), for instance in the caster's own area spells.
IF
  See(NearestEnemyOf(Myself))
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    AttackReevaluate(NearestEnemyOf(Myself),15)
END
